# App sidebar — Production (bắt buộc)

Skill: `.cursor/skills/app-sidebar/SKILL.md` (+ `reference.md`)

**Mẫu vàng:** `AppChrome.vue` + `useAppSidebar.js` + `Components/Layout/AppSidebar*.vue` + `app/Support/Navigation.php`.

| Layer | File |
|-------|------|
| Shell | `Layouts/AppChrome.vue` (`provide` sidebar) |
| State | `composables/useAppSidebar.js` |
| Desktop | `AppSidebar.vue` (`w-[5.75rem]` rail / `w-72`) |
| Nav UI | `AppSidebarExpandedNav`, `AppSidebarRailNav`, `RailFlyout`, `RailTooltip` |
| Mobile | `AppSidebarMobileDrawer.vue` |
| Brand | `AppSidebarBrand` |
| Config | `Navigation.php` → Inertia `nav` |

## 1. Cấu trúc

```
AppChrome → AppSidebar + MobileDrawer (không remount theo page)
useAppSidebar → rail, groups collapse, activeHref, flyout/tip
Nav → backend Navigation::for (+ badges)
```

## 2. Responsive

| Breakpoint | UI |
|------------|-----|
| `< lg` | Mobile drawer (`mobileOpen`) |
| `≥ lg` | Aside rail / expanded |

- Persist: `va-workspace.sidebar.rail`, `va-workspace.sidebar.collapsed`
- Đổi URL → đóng drawer + flyout; click ngoài đóng flyout (rail)

## 3. Logo collapse (rail)

- Expanded/drawer: wordmark `vas-white.png`
- Rail: mark `vas-white-mark.png` (+ `@2x`) trong ô `h-10 w-10` ring — **không** scale wordmark dài
- Mẫu: `AppSidebarBrand.vue` (parity VA-HRM `SidebarLogo`)

## 4. Groups & items

- Expanded: accordion group; Rail: icon + tooltip + flyout menu
- Active: longest-prefix `href` trong `useAppSidebar`
- Status: `live|dev|maintenance|planned` — badge / tone rail
- Class: `sidebar-nav-item--active`, `sidebar-nav-scroll`, `bg-brand`

## 5. Anti-patterns

- Sidebar mới trong page; remount shell mỗi visit
- Hard-code menu FE thay `Navigation.php`
- Rail không flyout; sửa width mà quên flyout/layout
- Rail dùng wordmark thay mark

## 6. Checklist

- [ ] Sửa qua AppSidebar* + useAppSidebar + Navigation.php
- [ ] Rail / expanded / drawer đồng bộ; logo mark khi rail
- [ ] Persist + active + status đúng
- [ ] `data-tour="sidebar"` giữ nếu có tour
